[h1]Compatibility:[/h1]
[list]
 [*]Not Ironman/Achievement Compatible.
 [*]Fully save game compatible.
 [*]Should work with any mod.
 [*]I may add compatibility patches upon request.
[/list]

In addition to the pinned suggestions discussion, you can also ask any questions, report bugs, or make suggestions in the [url=$REPLACE_ME$]#$REPLACE_ME$ channel of the $REPLACE_ME$ discord server[/url]. And if you are interested in joining in the development of this or one of my other mods, you can ping or add me on Discord @$REPLACE_ME$. All contributions are welcome.

The source and dev versions of the mod are available on [url=$REPLACE_ME$]GitHub.[/url]

